<p>M04-T12-FENCE-READY is a partial, independently verified output of existing04-T12, owned by I, requiring only approvedC04-COUNTS. Its Rules/test guards deny private maintenance access and paused-root comment creation while preserving authorized active/absent-fence behavior. Both04-T08 and04-T09 require this milestone before rehearsal. Neither depends on whole04-T12 completion, so no B15→B16→B15 cycle is introduced. Full04-T12 and W04-W6-CODE acceptance retain their original final B16 gates. No new wave is fabricated for this partial handoff.</p>
