<p>B11 originally required B10 and approved <code>M03-T16-RED-READY</code>; those prerequisites were satisfied before its implementation. B11 now has a verified interim handoff, while final spanning acceptance remains pending. The preparation adapter/view/fixture are I-only writes; QA runs the real existing-flow R07 business assertion under E-RUNTIME. New helper imports failing to resolve, absent callable endpoints, compilation/environment failures and skipped tests are not RED evidence. Actual implementation still requires behavioral RED, GREEN, independent review and integration acceptance. Preparation is not a finding closure or production authorization; all 17 prior emulator obligations, full Flutter tests and physical-device acceptance remain mandatory.</p>
